--- /dev/null
+++ b/target/linux/generic/backport-6.6/0005-net-phy-fill-in-missing-MODULE_DESCRIPTION-s.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+From dd9d75fcf0f427ddcde4bde736908684ee05c353 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Andrew Lunn <andrew@lunn.ch>
+Date: Sat, 28 Oct 2023 20:44:57 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH 05/15] net: phy: fill in missing MODULE_DESCRIPTION()s
+
+W=1 builds now warn if a module is built without a
+MODULE_DESCRIPTION(). Fill them in based on the Kconfig text, or
